OL,3,GNEWSANeurodivergence and 'northern
OL,4,Agrit' inspire horror mockumentary
OL,5,
OL,6,FA York-based writer and director who
OL,7,Fwas diagnosed with autism and ADHD last
OL,8,Fyear at the age of 43 says he hopes a
OL,9,Fnew horror mockumentary he is creating
OL,10,Fwill let people like him "see
OL,11,Fthemselves in the characters and get
OL,12,Finspiration".
OL,14,FJay Sillence says The Four Horsemen of
OL,15,FMuckenthwaite, whose script has already
OL,16,Fbeen nominated for 17 awards worldwide,
OL,17,Fincluding the New York and Chicago
OL,18,FScript Awards, is about characters who
OL,19,F"just can't quite fit in".
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
