OL,3,GNEWSANeurodivergence and 'northern
OL,4,Agrit' inspire horror mockumentary
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe film tells the story of the
OL,7,Fbiblical Four Horsemen of the
OL,8,FApocalypse, but with the twist that
OL,9,Fthey have been sacked from the
OL,10,Funderworld and need to get part-time
OL,11,Fjobs in a fictional town in the north
OL,12,Fof England.
OL,14,FJay says he and co-writer Dan Marshall
OL,15,Foriginally came up with the idea 10
OL,16,Fyears ago, working it into a "fully
OL,17,Ffunctional 20-odd minute script" on
OL,18,Fvideo calls during the Covid lockdown.
